/target
**/*.rs.bk
/.vscode
/.cargo

# Flutter engine libraries. `scripts/build-engine.sh --out DIR` and the README
# examples drop a ~40 MB libflutter_engine.so into one of these directories;
# an unguarded `git add` would otherwise stage it.
# (flutter-tools needs nothing here: it caches downloads under the user's
# cache dir, outside the tree.)
/.engine
/.engine-*
**/.engine/
**/.engine-*/
libflutter_engine.so
libflutter_engine.dylib
flutter_engine.dll
flutter_engine.dll.lib
FlutterEmbedder.framework/
icudtl.dat

# Note: Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. It is tracked, and CI builds
# with `--locked` against it.
